          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, burned in boiler atm. low-NOx condensing non-modulating &lt;100kW
na;
Synonyms: Brennwerttechnik; 
UUID: 8ee387aa-1c75-3f7e-a2bd-709f8a0c8381
